#: ../../INSTALL.md:1 7d6670ce1d2b424a96b65c2b432cee1f
msgid "Building ql-backend"
msgstr ""

#: ../../INSTALL.md:3 7208226cb9834b13a65bccc3619ea8b7
msgid ""
"Two routes. **Route A builds QuantLib from a submodule** and works "
"unmodified from a fresh clone; **Route B links an installed QuantLib** "
"and is faster to rebuild once you have one. They differ only in where "
"QuantLib comes from — the rest of the build is identical."
msgstr ""

#: ../../INSTALL.md:8 7376e2df527a4c2ba2eea33cf2ba3fb1
msgid ""
"Route B is the default in `CMakeLists.txt`, because a QuantLib build is "
"nearly a thousand translation units and you do not want to repeat it. "
"Route A is the one to start with, because it cannot be misconfigured."
msgstr ""

#: ../../INSTALL.md:12 1289afc363c747a2948f83fd85b762c7
msgid ""
"The targets are `qlservice` (the static library) and `ql-backend` (the "
"daemon, which shares its name with the CMake project). The build options "
"below are spelled `QLSERVICE_*`, after the library."
msgstr ""

